            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">📄 PDF Download</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            Professional, print-ready PDF files – no watermarks, no ads.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">💰 Tax Support</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            Add GST, VAT, HST, or custom tax rates – per line item or overall.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">🎨 Custom Branding</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            Add your logo, business name, and payment terms – look professional.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">🔒 No Data Storage</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            Your information stays private – we don't store any invoice data.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4">
                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm h-100">
                    <div class="card-body p-4">
                        <h3 class="h5 fw-bold">📱 Works Anywhere</h3>
                        <p class="text-muted mb-0">
                            Desktop, tablet, or mobile – create invoices on the go.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="row align-items-center">
            <div class="col-lg-6">
                <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">How to Create an Invoice Online in 3 Simple Steps</h2>
                <ol class="text-muted mb-3">
                    <li class="mb-2"><strong>1. Fill in your details</strong> – Add your business name, logo, client info, and line items (description, quantity, rate).</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><strong>2. Set tax and payment terms</strong> – Choose tax rate, add discounts or deposits, and specify due date.</li>
                    <li class="mb-2"><strong>3. Generate PDF</strong> – Click the button and your professional invoice downloads instantly.</li>
                </ol>
                <p class="text-muted mb-3">
                    No learning curve, no registration, no hidden fees. Just fast, free invoicing.
                </p>
                <ul class="list-unstyled">
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ 100% free – unlimited invoices</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ No watermark or promotional text</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ Works for any business type</li>
                    <li class="mb-2">✔ Secure and private</li>
                </ul>
            </div>

            <div class="col-lg-6 mt-4 mt-lg-0">
                <div class="bg-primary text-white rounded-4 p-5 shadow-lg">
                    <h3 class="fw-bold mb-4">Start Invoicing Online – Free</h3>
                    <p class="mb-4">
                        Create your first invoice now. No strings attached.
                    </p>
                    <a href="https://ratpdf.com/Invoice/Create" class="btn btn-light btn-lg fw-semibold">
                        Open Invoice Generator
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5 bg-light">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="text-center mb-5">
            <h2 class="fw-bold">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion" id="faqAccordion">
            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq1">
                    <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse1">
                        Do I need to create an account to use this invoice generator?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        No account, no email, no password. Just open the page, create your invoice, and download – we don't store any data.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq2">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse2">
                        Can I download the invoice as a PDF?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes, all invoices are generated as high-quality PDF files, ready for immediate download.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq3">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse3">
                        Is this really free? Are there any watermarks?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Completely free. No watermarks, no "trial version" stamps, no ads – just clean, professional PDFs.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq4">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse4">
                        What tax rates can I use?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        You can set any tax rate per line item – 0%, 5%, 9%, 10%, 15%, 18%, 20%, or custom. Supports GST, VAT, HST, and sales tax.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="accordion-item">
                <h2 class="accordion-header" id="faq5">
                    <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse5">
                        Can I add multiple line items?
                    </button>
                </h2>
                <div id="collapse5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                    <div class="accordion-body">
                        Yes, you can add as many line items as needed, each with its own description, quantity, rate, and tax rate.
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="py-5">
    <div class="container text-center">
        <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3">Create Your Free Invoice Now – No Signup, No Hassle</h2>
        <p class="text-muted mb-4">
